# Preserve the exact bytes of the existing-release publisher package installed on
# the Host (package manifest 71ee46c6). These files carry CRLF lines and their
# digests are pinned by the package source freeze (the manager also by the
# package manifest and existing-stages.mjs), so git must not normalize them.
